# Copie para .env.local (nunca commite o .local com chaves).
# Supabase (dashboard > Settings > API).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://xyzcompany.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...
# Google OAuth (login com Google via Supabase Auth):
# 1. No Google Cloud Console (APIs & Services > Credentials), garanta que o
#    OAuth Client tenha comoAuthorized redirect URI:
#    https://xyzcompany.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
# 2. No Supabase Dashboard > Authentication > Providers > Google, ative o provider
#    e cole o Client ID e o Client Secret do Google.
# OBS: Client ID/Secret ficam SÓ no dashboard do Supabase (server-side).
# Nunca coloque o Client Secret em VITE_* ou commite no git.
